the upcoming CD debut, too?

00:14:28.577 --> 00:14:29.870
That's right!

00:14:29.870 --> 00:14:33.415
We still haven't recorded the song yet, though.

00:14:33.415 --> 00:14:37.920
But Hemocchi here has a record of
placing first in a Cat Productions audition!

00:14:37.920 --> 00:14:40.464
She must be great at singing, too!

00:14:41.548 --> 00:14:42.674
--P--
--Huh?

00:14:42.674 --> 00:14:46.011
Please don't hate me, Ino-<i>sempai</i>!

00:14:46.011 --> 00:14:47.554
Wha-- What?!

00:14:47.554 --> 00:14:48.472
Huh?

00:14:48.472 --> 00:14:50.474
Maybe she's not that good.

00:14:51.308 --> 00:14:54.102
Actually, the audition I placed first in

00:14:54.102 --> 00:14:58.273
was for the girl with the best
black-haired pigtails in Japan.

00:14:58.273 --> 00:15:00.651
Th-That's quite the audition...

00:15:00.651 --> 00:15:03.487
I'm not too aware of the specifics myself,

00:15:03.487 --> 00:15:06.156
but Miss Riri seemed to be the initiator.

00:15:06.156 --> 00:15:09.701
It's all about the black-haired
pigtails from now on.

00:15:09.701 --> 00:15:10.702
Oh...

00:15:10.702 --> 00:15:15.874
Ah, but she said the idea was
suggested by somebody else.

00:15:15.874 --> 00:15:17.209
Do it.

00:15:17.209 --> 00:15:19.962
Let's not think too much about it.

00:15:19.962 --> 00:15:23.298
So I'm not too confident in my singing...

00:15:25.843 --> 00:15:27.052
Oh! Then!

00:15:27.052 --> 00:15:29.930
Why don't we all go practice singing now?

00:15:29.930 --> 00:15:30.764
Oh?

00:15:30.764 --> 00:15:31.932
Let's go karaoke!

00:15:31.932 --> 00:15:32.975
Karaoke?!

00:15:32.975 --> 00:15:33.934
Yes!

00:15:33.934 --> 00:15:37.604
Believe it or not,
I've actually never been before.

00:15:37.604 --> 00:15:41.024
Great idea! Then we can sing our hearts out!

00:15:42.234 --> 00:15:45.779
By everyone, does that mean I can join, too?

00:15:45.779 --> 00:15:46.905
Of course!

00:15:46.905 --> 00:15:49.199
Th-Then...!

00:15:50.075 --> 00:15:54.538
