00:15:58.917 --> 00:16:01.503
These two really are suspicious!

00:16:01.503 --> 00:16:02.796
"Karaoke"

00:16:07.342 --> 00:16:09.344
So this is karaoke!

00:16:09.344 --> 00:16:13.390
Now I really feel like I'm
a high school girl in the city!

00:16:13.390 --> 00:16:16.268
Don't get too excited, Miss Sakura.

00:16:16.268 --> 00:16:18.187
Oh, by the way...

00:16:18.187 --> 00:16:22.191
Don't you all need to hide
your faces since you're idols?

00:16:27.362 --> 00:16:28.906
The room's so big!

00:16:28.906 --> 00:16:30.532
The machines are high-tech, too!

00:16:30.532 --> 00:16:34.369
It's so cheap for all of this,
including a drink!

00:16:34.369 --> 00:16:35.996
It makes me very happy.

00:16:35.996 --> 00:16:37.497
I've been watching the show.

00:16:37.497 --> 00:16:40.083
Mouse House seems really tight on money.

00:16:40.083 --> 00:16:43.545
But in reality, is it really that bad?

00:16:45.130 --> 00:16:49.259
Of course not! It's just a production for TV!

00:16:49.259 --> 00:16:53.555
Our neighbors are generous
and give us food, too!

00:16:55.891 --> 00:16:58.894
Maybe I wasn't supposed to ask that...

00:16:58.894 --> 00:17:01.480
Hey, so who's singing first?

00:17:01.480 --> 00:17:03.607
It has to be Hemo, of course!

00:17:03.607 --> 00:17:04.566
