00:17:11.114 --> 00:17:12.407
What?! Me?!

00:17:12.407 --> 00:17:15.911
You're making me sing in front of idols?

00:17:15.911 --> 00:17:17.496
It's just that...

00:17:17.496 --> 00:17:19.831
